        "Values": [
          {
            "FieldName": "MemberIntroduction",
            "Value": "Julien, a John Molson School of Business graduate, has been excelling in sales since 2016. His passion for real estate began early. With experience in high-value transactions and global marketing, he brings sharp market insight and strong negotiation skills. Licensed in residential and commercial real estate since 2020, he now helps clients navigate the market with confidence as a key member of Immeubles Montria."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "Locale": "fr",
        "TranslationKey": "Member.121910.fr",
        "Values": [
          {
            "FieldName": "MemberIntroduction",
            "Value": "Julien, diplômé de l'université John-Molson, excelle en vente depuis 2016. Passionné d’immobilier depuis son jeune âge. Fort d’une expertise en transactions de grande valeur et en marketing international, il possède un sens aigu du marché et de solides compétences en négociation. Courtier résidentiel et commercial depuis 2020, il accompagne ses clients avec confiance au sein d’Immeubles Montria."
          }
        ]
      }
